   OVERLAP ( prBoundary snapBoundary TEXT OVERLAP SRAM PO_TEXT SEALRING LOGO ANALOG FUSE FILLER VIAEXCL PSUB CAPDUM CAP3DUM INDDUMMY IND2DUMMY IND3DUMMY RESWDUM M1RESDUM M2RESDUM M3RESDUM M4RESDUM M5RESDUM M6RESDUM M7RESDUM M8RESDUM M9RESDUM M10RESDUM M11RESDUM BJTDUM VPNP2DUM VPNP5DUM VPNP10DUM NPN2DUM NPN5DUM NPN10DUM NPNDUMMY PNPDUMMY DIODUMMY ESDDUMMY BACKGROUND ANNOTATE MARKER INSTANCE ALIGN HARDFENCE SOFTFENCE BORDER DEVICE WIRE PIN AXIS EDGELAYER SNAP STRETCH Y0 Y1 Y2 Y3 Y4 Y5 Y6 Y7 Y8 Y9 HILITE DRIVE HIZ RESIST SPIKE SUPPLY UNKNOWN UNSET DESIGNFLOW CHANGEDLAYER ROW UNROUTED GROUP CANNOTOCCUPY CANPLACE SNA )
end

labels
POLY text_for POLY scale labelscale
M1L text_for M1P or METAL1 scale labelscale
METAL1 text_for METAL1 scale labelscale
METAL2 text_for METAL2 scale labelscale
